From 517c9283b3f482e4e904671beaf72ba4d42dcbfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W1nkelm4nn <mrmarkap61@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 17:40:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] vkd3d: Report feature level 12_0 on KosmicKrisp.

Like MoltenVK, KosmicKrisp has neither sparse residency nor logic ops,
which held it at feature level 11_1 although it meets the rest of 12_0.
Unreal Engine 5 refuses Direct3D 12 below 12_0 and asked to run without
-dx12. Extend the portability exception for MoltenVK to it.
---
 libs/vkd3d/device.c | 10 ++++++----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/device.c b/libs/vkd3d/device.c
index 598706e..17c6acf 100644
--- a/libs/vkd3d/device.c
+++ b/libs/vkd3d/device.c
@@ -9774,11 +9774,13 @@ static void d3d12_device_caps_init_feature_level(struct d3d12_device *device)
             caps->options.TypedUAVLoadAdditionalFormats)
         caps->max_feature_level = D3D_FEATURE_LEVEL_12_0;
 
-    /* MoltenVK has neither sparse residency nor logic ops, which would hold portability devices at 11_0
-     * although they meet the rest of 12_0. Report 12_0 with the real tiled resources tier and logic op
-     * support, so that games requiring 12_0 start and those checking the caps avoid what is missing. */
+    /* MoltenVK and KosmicKrisp have neither sparse residency nor logic ops, which would hold portability
+     * devices at 11_0 although they meet the rest of 12_0. Report 12_0 with the real tiled resources tier
+     * and logic op support, so that games requiring 12_0 start and those checking the caps avoid what is
+     * missing. */
     if (caps->max_feature_level < D3D_FEATURE_LEVEL_12_0 &&
-            device->device_info.vulkan_1_2_properties.driverID == VK_DRIVER_ID_MOLTENVK &&
+            (device->device_info.vulkan_1_2_properties.driverID == VK_DRIVER_ID_MOLTENVK ||
+            device->device_info.vulkan_1_2_properties.driverID == (VkDriverId)28 /* KosmicKrisp */) &&
             features->vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics &&
             caps->options.ResourceBindingTier >= D3D12_RESOURCE_BINDING_TIER_2 &&
             caps->options.TypedUAVLoadAdditionalFormats)
-- 
2.56.0

